WEBVTT

00:03:28.287 --> 00:03:31.749
Shunda kattaroq sonni taxmin qilib,
qaytadan urinib ko’ra olasiz.

00:03:31.749 --> 00:03:34.752
Tizimli bo’lish uchun siz taxminlaringizni

00:03:34.752 --> 00:03:37.672
aniq bir songa oshirib borishingiz mumkin,
aytaylik 4ga.

00:03:37.755 --> 00:03:39.507
Agar jami shamlar 99ta bo’lganida,

00:03:39.715 --> 00:03:46.305
usul davomida 24ta aylanish, 2,700 shamni
ko’rib chiqishingizga to’g’ri keladi

00:03:46.472 --> 00:03:49.600
Ammo, siz taxminlaringizni tezlikda
oshirishingiz kerak emas.

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:54.063
Masalan, siz ikki barobarga oshirishingiz
mumkin, 10 dan 20 dan 40 gacha,

00:03:54.063 --> 00:03:59.610
va taxminan 560 shamdan keyin,
5-sayohatingizda haqiqiy raqamni topasiz.

00:03:59.986 --> 00:04:03.197
Ikki barobar oshirib, siz katta
raqamlarni osonlik bilan topasiz,